---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Terms and Conditions | Real Car Mileage";
const description = "Terms and conditions for using Real Car Mileage, including calculators, vehicle mileage data, fuel prices and trip planning tools.";
const keywords = "terms and conditions, real car mileage terms, disclaimer, fuel calculator usage";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords} ogType="article">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#27272a] bg-white dark:bg-[#121215] shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 transition-colors">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs text-[#888] dark:text-[#71717a] hover:text-[#171717] dark:hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#171717] dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded-sm">← Back to home</a>

    <div class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#888] dark:text-[#71717a] text-pretty">Legal</div>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[#888] dark:text-[#71717a]">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Use of the site</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      By using Real Car Mileage you agree to these terms. The site provides automotive information, mileage estimates and calculators for general reference only.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">No warranty</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      All mileage figures, fuel prices, vehicle data and calculations are provided "as is" without warranty of accuracy, completeness or fitness for a particular purpose. Real-world fuel economy varies with traffic, driving style, fuel quality, weather, tyre pressure, load and vehicle condition.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Estimates and financial decisions</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      Trip-cost and fuel calculations are estimates based on the inputs and assumptions you provide. Fuel prices are indicative and may differ by city, station and date. Do not rely on these figures alone for purchase, finance or legal decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Content and intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      The site's text, design, database presentation and calculators are protected by applicable copyright and intellectual-property laws. You may use the information for personal research. You may not scrape, republish or resell the database or derived content without written permission.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Third-party links</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      External links are provided for convenience. We are not responsible for the content, availability or privacy practices of third-party websites.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, Real Car Mileage and its operators are not liable for direct or indirect losses, costs, damages or decisions arising from the use of information on this site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Governing law</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any dispute shall be subject to the competent courts or tribunals in India.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white text-balance scroll-mt-24">Changes</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#444] dark:text-[#d4d4d8] leading-relaxed">
      We may revise these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the revised terms.
    </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
